  deprioritized: "rmw3, 2026-08-10, after being told the key is live on origin: 'git es privado, a la mierda, no me interesa verlo ahora.' Repo is private — origin exposure is lower-stakes than a public leak. Git-history disposition parked, not blocking BOOT-RECONCILE-2026-08-10 or anything else. Key rotation at Google's console still recommended whenever convenient, just not urgent by rmw3's call.",
