          universal YA es regla canon, no convención.
      (c) Child (S1) ✓ despachado — envelope child/docs/deploy/
          2026-08-15_parent_dispatch_rectif_child_destructive.vsm + task
          CHILD-DESTRUCTIVE-GATE-2026-08-15 (child commit e956314,
          feat/s1-child); implementación del child se verifica en
          RECTIF-CHILD-DESTRUCTIVE (open) cuando haga su intake.
      La política vive AHORA en el canon (R17) + agente S3 + child
      (despachado) — esta task queda como registro de la lección.",
  what: "Never terminate another agent's session/process without rmw3's
      EXPLICIT confirmation of THAT specific action. Lesson 2026-08-11:
      rmw3 asked 'guardar nosotros y restaurar el entorno' (save state,
      leave env clean) — the executor interpreted it as authorization to
      kill the hung child tmux session. It was not. The kill was
      recoverable (OpenCode sessions persist in ~/.local/share/opencode/
      opencode.db, resumable) but the process was wrong: the triple gate "
      was applied to WHAT (lost=hung session) and CAN IT (recover=yes)
      but never asked 'has rmw3 confirmed this specific action?'.",
  gate: "None — this is the lesson itself.",
  done_when: "Every future destructive action (kill-session, kill PID,
      pct destroy, rm -rf, git reset --hard outside own branch) requires
      an explicit 'sí/confirma' from rmw3 in the SAME turn before
      executing. Convention: ask the question, wait for the answer.",
  status_note: "Enforced by convention + this task. If a supervisor agent
      (Claude) sees a session block claiming a kill without quoting the
      explicit confirmation, flag it as a rule violation.",
  impl_audit_2026_08_15: "AUDITORÍA DE IMPLEMENTACIÓN (R4, 2026-08-15):
      (a) Agente S3 root — ✓ IMPLEMENTADA (triple gate en vsf-s3-planner.md
      :120-121: lost? recoverable? rmw3 confirmed this specific action?).
      (b) hard_rules.vsm — ✗ NO ESTÁ como regla canon: solo convención +
      esta task. Es una regla de comportamiento UNIVERSAL (aplica a todo
      agente, no solo [S]) → candidata a R17 (S5, doble-loop — rmw3
      decide). RESUELTO 2026-08-15: R17 ratificada en canon (hard_rules.vsm
      :108-124, commit 429e4d87, task R17-DESTRUCTIVE-EXPLICIT-CONSENT).
      (c) Child (S1) — ✗ su agente vsf-s1-executor.md NO la
